WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.607
Day 6. Two more pairs.

2
00:00:02.057 --> 00:00:08.869
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.369 --> 00:00:13.652
Here is today's first pair. It makes the same sound as the start of window.

4
00:00:18.325 --> 00:00:19.264
The word is when.

5
00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:23.921
The word is which.

6
00:00:24.821 --> 00:00:32.208
Job two is a pair your child already knows, from short words like duck. Two letters, one sound, at the end of a word.

7
00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:37.214
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box at the top. Read them out.

8
00:00:37.664 --> 00:00:42.188
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

9
00:00:42.638 --> 00:00:46.671
If a word goes wrong, do not say it. Say the same words every time.

10
00:00:47.121 --> 00:00:50.200
Two letters, one sound. Find the pair. Then wait.

11
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.573
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

12
00:00:57.023 --> 00:01:00.485
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
